8
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:26,080
(HR Woman:)I don't even know what that means...

9
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:29,050
(HR Woman:)...but I'm gonna go ahead
and tell you you can't say it.

10
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:33,360
Oh, I see the confusion here.

11
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:36,730
(Sheldon:)Alex thought I was singling her out. No.

12
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:41,650
(Sheldon:)I meant that all women
are slaves to their biological urges.

13
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:43,210
(Sheldon:)Even you.

14
00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:47,040
(Sheldon:)You're a slave.

15
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:54,020
(HR Woman:)I'm a what?

